  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_01",
      "hash64": "60E84D9A515A901A",
      "text": "今天也要精力充沛地学习对战学！\\n嘿呀！让我们开始吧！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_02",
      "hash64": "60E84C9A515A8E67",
      "text": "之前我教的太晶团体战！\\n各位同学去挑战了吗！？[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_03",
      "hash64": "60E84B9A515A8CB4",
      "text": "太晶宝可梦可是强敌！\\n要是遇上高难度的对手，\\r\\n它还会采取很棘手的行动……[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_04",
      "hash64": "60E84A9A515A8B01",
      "text": "那就是[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]太晶护盾[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_05",
      "hash64": "60E8499A515A894E",
      "text": "如果对手展开了太晶护盾……[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_06",
      "hash64": "60E8489A515A879B",
      "text": "那我方能给予的\\n伤害就会大量减少！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_07",
      "hash64": "60E8479A515A85E8",
      "text": "太晶护盾一旦被发动……[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_08",
      "hash64": "60E8469A515A8435",
      "text": "我方就会无计可施，\\n很可能就此落败……！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_09",
      "hash64": "60E8459A515A8282",
      "text": "现在我要提问了！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_10",
      "hash64": "60E4C89A51577844",
      "text": "当对手展开太晶护盾时，\\n我们应该怎么办呢！？[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_e_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "AB71E26C3F620374",
      "text": "静静闭上眼睛",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_e_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "AB71E56C3F62088D",
      "text": "给家里打电话",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_e_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "AB71E46C3F6206DA",
      "text": "太晶化后去攻击",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_answer_01",
      "hash64": "956C446586DBA4F3",
      "text": "喂喂喂，\\n别那么轻易地就接受最后一刻啊！\\r\\n努力挣扎应该就能打开突破口的！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_answer_02",
      "hash64": "956C456586DBA6A6",
      "text": "喂喂喂，\\n你是要在永别来临之前跟家人说话吗！？\\r\\n努力挣扎应该就能打开突破口的！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_answer_03",
      "hash64": "956C466586DBA859",
      "text": "正确答案！\\n转学生你真是太晶团体战的大师呢！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_11",
      "hash64": "60E4C99A515779F7",
      "text": "对于展开了太晶护盾的对手，\\n普通的攻击是不太奏效的！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_12",
      "hash64": "60E4CA9A51577BAA",
      "text": "但是，如果我方也通过太晶化去攻击，\\n就会是有效的手段！\\c\\n如果使用太晶属性的招式，\\n还能给予更大的伤害！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_13",
      "hash64": "60E4CB9A51577D5D",
      "text": "只要持续给予伤害，\\n就能破坏太晶护盾，\\r\\n还能让对手失去平衡！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_14",
      "hash64": "60E4C49A51577178",
      "text": "所以在太晶团体战中\\n使用太晶化的时机也非常重要。[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_15",
      "hash64": "60E4C59A5157732B",
      "text": "结论！！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_16",
      "hash64": "60E4C69A515774DE",
      "text": "俗话说以牙还牙！\\n对付太晶化，就要用太晶化！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_17",
      "hash64": "60E4C79A51577691",
      "text": "请各位务必与伙伴好好配合，\\n击垮对方的太晶护盾。[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_18",
      "hash64": "60E4C09A51576AAC",
      "text": "唔唔！我本来想让各位亲身体验的，\\n想不到时间已经到了……[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_19",
      "hash64": "60E4C19A51576C5F",
      "text": "下堂课是期中考试哟！\\n要争取拿１００分！嘿呀！嘿呀！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
